  "description": "The Index 2.0 is a rad first 20\" BMX bike! The index features a single speed drivetrain, alloy front caliper brake and rear U-brake, and large 2.4\" tires. Plus, this bike comes with 4 freestyle pegs and a cable rotor that allows for barspins!\nBMX freestyle frame and 25/9 cassette gearing.\nAlloy caliper brake and rear U-brake for precision braking.\nLarge 2.4 inch tires provide extra stability and grip.\nFour freestyle pegs and cable rotor that allows for 360 degree spins.\n20\" wheel fits children 6+ years old, or 4'0\" to 5'0\".",
